# SLICE-01c: ECS::StaticMeshComponent is REFLECTED like UE's UStaticMeshComponent (StaticMesh + OverrideMaterials):
# DesertCtl `set` reaches StaticMeshComponent.MeshHandle and ONE element StaticMesh.MaterialSlots[0], each `assets:` path
# checked against the field's Asset<T> (ContentKindForAssetType), and the edit re-states its dependants
# (ECS::PostEditStaticMesh: a mesh clears the Primitive, the material instances rebuild from the slots).
# The cube (Primitive Cube, slot 0 = Starter_Prop) gets another mesh and another material, then a texture as its
# material (refused with the reason in editor.log), then the scene is saved and reopened.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
# The cube (100 cm, centre 0,50,150) fills about a third of the view.
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,130,360
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.38,-1
Тогда-вид 0_before the grey Starter_Prop cube, whole, centred
Когда set 6018453462564557835 StaticMeshComponent.MeshHandle assets:Meshes/Modeling/Blockout.stmesh
Когда set 6018453462564557835 StaticMeshComponent.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Materials/CB_Red.demat
# Blockout.stmesh is the box 0..200 x 100..200 x 100..300 (local), so with the entity at 0,50,150 its centre is 100,200,350.
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 100,330,900
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.236,-1
Тогда-вид 1_swapped the Blockout box, whole, centred, in the red CB material - not the grey cube
Когда --expect-refusal set 6018453462564557835 StaticMeshComponent.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Textures/T_Checker.detex
Тогда-вид 2_refused unchanged from 1_swapped; editor.log has "[Control] set ... refused: 'assets:Textures/T_Checker.detex' is a Texture, not a Material"
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 100,330,900
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.236,-1
Тогда-вид 3_reopen same as 1_swapped after the reopen (the saved mesh + material round-trip)
# A click on the box at the viewport's centre selects the entity.
Когда drag 717,428 717,428
Тогда 4_details the Details panel's Static Mesh row is an asset slot naming Blockout (the Preview thumbnail above it), no "(no Details slot ...)"
